@YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5026

### A match: the districts over an address in Raleigh
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?address=16%20W%20Jones%20St,%20Raleigh%20NC
Accept: application/json

### The same place, from a point
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?lat=35.7822&lon=-78.6398
Accept: application/json

### No match: 404, because the geocoder cannot place this
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?address=nowhere%20at%20all
Accept: application/json

### No match again: placed perfectly well, and in no state the site covers
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?address=1600%20Pennsylvania%20Ave,%20Washington%20DC
Accept: application/json

###
